  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Traces of residual ether wick over your weapons whenever you are affected by an etherspell.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Ethermagic class feature, caster level 4th</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> While under the effects of an alteration etherspell or a bestow etherspell, weapons you wield are treated as magic for the purpose of bypassing damage reduction. Further, weapons you wield with an enhancement bonus increase their enhancement bonus by +1.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
